      "cooked": "<p>Was able to play a game tonight at wizards wagon with Christopher and Adam and another player, Josh tonight.&nbsp;</p><p>We played omnitron advance at omnitron with</p><p>adam-skyscraper&nbsp;</p><p>Christopher- captain cosmic&nbsp;</p><p>me-<span>naturalist</span></p><p><span>josh- omnitron x</span></p><p><span>was a long game and we didn't have time to finish but was a nice slug fest. The environment gave us the most trouble and we lost skyscraper at the end but we were able to get him down to 50 before we had to end it.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>wanted to say again,thanks for the game tonight Adam and Christopher, I had fun and with this probably being my last day off for the next 3 1/2 months it was worth the two hour drive. :)</span></p>",
